From 948990c8ee7c6fd69233b0c2e287e4ae6a9aafdc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:18:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 1: fix CI type errors, extract ledger maths, add unit
 tests

- bad() is now a function declaration so TypeScript narrows after it (fixes 'possibly null' errors)
- Type the settings collection; guard null result in transaction PUT
- Extract balance and safe-to-spend arithmetic into lib/ledger.ts (pure, tested)
- Add node:test suite (tsx) and run it in CI
- Remove stray tailwind-migration.patch from repo root
---
 .github/workflows/nextjs.yml   |    1 +
 next-env.d.ts                  |    4 +-
 package-lock.json              |  519 +++++
 package.json                   |    4 +-
 src/app/api/[...path]/route.ts |   13 +-
 src/lib/finance.ts             |   18 +-
 src/lib/ledger.ts              |   59 +
 src/lib/money.ts               |    2 +
 tailwind-migration.patch       | 3582 --------------------------------
 tests/ledger.test.ts           |   92 +
 10 files changed, 693 insertions(+), 3601 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/lib/ledger.ts
 create mode 100644 src/lib/money.ts
 delete mode 100644 tailwind-migration.patch
 create mode 100644 tests/ledger.test.ts

